  <FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/rclone-jobs/README.md" Mode="0644">
<INLINE>
Scheduled rclone and rsync job manager for Unraid 7 with a dry-run gate, mount guard, deletion limits, live SSE progress monitoring, and native Unraid notifications (webGui bell, email, Telegram).
</INLINE>
<SHA256>6e56f07bbd09b3af3a8755ab78f2998d72e8273aae2fdd4b125754d3dfcdb658</SHA256>
